# Food items (bread, cheese, soup, etc.) - parallel to fluid for the Phase 10
# trap-set / trap-fire arc. tainted_with names the substance added. WHO
# tampered lives in beliefs + the hsim-side live-traps registry, not as an
# env attr.
archetype "food" (cap 256) (mech obs) (occupies-env-grid) (non-occluder)
{
    "controlled_by"
    "obb"
    "tainted_with"
}
